§ `Section 8: references to distance`

#ASSERT `section 8 — the way a distance is measured` FALSE EQUALS `in a straight line on a horizontal plane`
#ASSERT REFUSED `section 8 — the way a distance is measured` TRUE BECAUSE "section 8 gives no way of measuring a distance where a contrary intention appears"

§ `Section 10: references to the Sovereign`

#ASSERT `section 10 — the Sovereign a reference is to be construed as` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the Sovereign for the time being`
