§ `Section 19: citation of other Acts`

-- (a) a revised edition printed by authority; (b) otherwise the Record Commission edition; (c) otherwise the Queen's Printer.
#ASSERT `section 19(1) — the edition a citation is read as referring to` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the revised edition of the statutes printed by authority`
