#ASSERT `section 19(1) — the edition a citation is read as referring to` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the edition prepared under the direction of the Record Commission`
#ASSERT `section 19(1) — the edition a citation is read as referring to` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the Acts printed by the Queen's Printer, or under the superintendence or authority of Her Majesty's Stationery Office`
#ASSERT REFUSED `section 19(1) — the edition a citation is read as referring to` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE BECAUSE "section 19(1) gives no edition unless an Act cites another Act or a portion of one and no contrary intention appears"
